      "content": "I need some help putting together a formal digital statement. I've spent years tracing my lineage back to the House of Valerius—a branch that was illegally stripped of its status and assets by the Council in the early 1900s. Now that I've finally surfaced, I'm finding that most of the official records have been scrubbed or manipulated to hide our existence. I need to draft a manifesto that outlines our historical legitimacy and calls for the unfreezing of the family trusts. How do I phrase this so it sounds like a legitimate reclamation of sovereignty rather than just a personal grievance?",
